# Pull request voice

When creating or drafting a pull request:

1. Read `$AGENT_RULES_PATH/general/pull-requests.md` (portable) or `agents/editorial/pull-requests.md` (org).
2. **Title:** simple language (e.g. `Make dark mode cover the preview and title bar`).
3. **Summary/intro:** plain English, inviting; lead with the human problem; short bullets; soft close.
4. **UI-visible changes:** before/after screenshots at minimum.

Do not put these only in `MEMORIES.md`.
